  "story": {
    "text": "That night a carriage drives up. It is not her mother but Willoughby, half {DRUNK}, come to explain. He did love Marianne; but he had {DEBTS}, and his aunt {DISOWNED} him over Eliza, so he married for {MONEY}. Now he is {MISERABLE}. Against her will, Elinor almost {FORGIVES} him.",
